# The daily self-update of os-frontpanel: the latest release on GitHub, taken only when it is ahead
# of what is installed. See /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/frontpanel/self-update.py.
#
# Once a day, at a minute of its own so that no two of these plugins install at the same time:
# each install restarts configd and the web GUI. Output to /dev/null; what happened is in the
# system log and in /usr/local/share/os-frontpanel/update.json.
29	3	*	*	*	root	/usr/local/opnsense/scripts/frontpanel/self-update.py > /dev/null 2>&1
